  "headBody": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>A post with hidden parts</title></head><body>\n<article><h1>A post with hidden parts</h1>\n<p>The visible introduction is short but real, and it sits above several blocks that a stylesheet or an attribute hides from view.</p>\n<div style=\"display:none\"><p>Inline display none block that should never be read.</p></div>\n<div style=\"display: none;\"><p>Spaced display none block.</p></div>\n<div hidden><p>Block with the hidden attribute.</p></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>Block hidden from assistive technology.</p></div>\n<div style=\"visibility:hidden\"><p>Invisible but laid out.</p></div>\n<div class=\"hidden\"><p>Tailwind style hidden class.</p></div>\n<div class=\"hidden sm:flex\"><p>Hidden on mobile, shown from the sm breakpoint.</p></div>\n<div style=\"opacity:0\"><p>Fully transparent.</p></div>\n<p>The closing paragraph is visible again and wraps the post up with a final remark about what was left unseen.</p></article>\n</body></html>\n"
